realm (0.1.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging skeleton. Ships the session contract only: the
    wayland-session entry, the session entry script implementing the ADR 0011 /
    SPEC 0005 environment handshake, the systemd user units with their
    realm-session.target.wants symlinks, the portal policy and palette.toml.
  * Requires and packages realmctl, realm-wm and realm-bar from the retained
    Realm workspace authority; a missing binary fails the package build.
  * Depends on a vendored river 0.4.x (realm-river); river 0.4 is the compositor
    realm drives over river-window-management-v1.
  * Package and security correspondence use the reachable maintainer contact
    declared in debian/control.

 -- realm contributors <vadim.evard@gmail.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
